OL,3,GNEWSADoor handles used to make weapons
OL,4,Aat youth prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FInmates at a young offender institution
OL,7,F(YOI) in West Yorkshire are using door
OL,8,Fhandles and food trolleys to make
OL,9,Fweapons, according to an inspection
OL,10,Freport.
OL,12,FHM Inspectorate of Prisons surveyed
OL,13,Fyoung people aged 12 to 18 in custody
OL,14,Fat four institutions, including
OL,15,FWetherby YOI, between April 2025 and
OL,16,FMarch this year.
OL,18,FIts report found inmates at Wetherby
OL,19,Fhad been constructing makeshift weapons
OL,20,Ffollowing a ban on razor blades, with
OL,21,Fthe new weapons considered more
OL,22,Fdangerous than those previously used.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
