OL,3,GNEWSADoor handles used to make weapons
OL,4,Aat youth prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Justice (MoJ) said a
OL,7,F"youth custody transformation plan" was
OL,8,Fbeing developed to improve safety and
OL,9,F"create an environment where
OL,10,Frehabilitation can succeed".
